# Sidecar for sim/viewer/Dockerfile. The root .dockerignore is `**` plus a
# narrow allowlist for the ROS images, which would exclude everything here.
#
# Exclude everything, then admit exactly what the build COPYs. Unlike the asset
# image's sidecar there is nothing seeded to admit: every input sits in the
# sim/viewer tree, whose content hash is the image's tag
# (config.compute_viewer_inputs_hash).
#
# Keep this set a SUBSET of the sim/viewer tree: admitting something outside it
# puts content into the image that the tree hash does not describe -- two
# payloads under one content address. tests/test_viewer_bundle_image.py
# enforces the other direction.
**

!sim/viewer/package.json
!sim/viewer/package-lock.json
!sim/viewer/tsconfig.json
!sim/viewer/vite.lib.config.ts
!sim/viewer/src/**

**/__pycache__/**
**/.DS_Store

!sim/viewer/config/**
